{"id":3,"slug":"best-time-to-buy-and-sell-stock","title":"Best Time to Buy and Sell Stock","difficulty":"Easy","tags":["Array","Dynamic Programming"],"description":"`prices[i]` is the price of a stock on day `i`. Buy on one day and sell on a later day to maximise profit.\n\nReturn the maximum profit you can achieve. If no profit is possible, return `0`.\n\n**Constraints**\n\n- `1 <= prices.length <= 2 * 10^5`\n- `0 <= prices[i] <= 10^4`","functionName":"maxProfit","params":["prices"],"tests":[{"input":[[7,1,5,3,6,4]],"output":5,"sample":true,"explanation":"Buy at 1, sell at 6."},{"input":[[7,6,4,3,1]],"output":0,"sample":true,"explanation":"Prices only fall."},{"input":[[1]],"output":0},{"input":[[2,4,1]],"output":2},{"input":[[3,3,3,3]],"output":0},{"input":[[1,2,3,4,5]],"output":4},{"input":[{"__gen__":"ints","n":1,"lo":0,"hi":10000,"seed":600}],"output":0},{"input":[{"__gen__":"ints","n":2,"lo":0,"hi":10000,"seed":601}],"output":259},{"input":[{"__gen__":"ints","n":3,"lo":0,"hi":10000,"seed":602}],"output":2752},{"input":[{"__gen__":"ints","n":5,"lo":0,"hi":10000,"seed":603}],"output":2885},{"input":[{"__gen__":"ints","n":10,"lo":0,"hi":10000,"seed":604}],"output":8336},{"input":[{"__gen__":"ints","n":25,"lo":0,"hi":10000,"seed":605}],"output":8497},{"input":[{"__gen__":"ints","n":100,"lo":0,"hi":10000,"seed":606}],"output":9683},{"input":[{"__gen__":"ints","n":1000,"lo":0,"hi":10000,"seed":607}],"output":9970},{"input":[{"__gen__":"ints","n":20000,"lo":0,"hi":10000,"seed":608}],"output":9995},{"input":[{"__gen__":"ints","n":200000,"lo":0,"hi":10000,"seed":609}],"output":10000},{"input":[{"__gen__":"arange","n":100000,"start":0,"step":1}],"output":99999},{"input":[{"__gen__":"arange","n":100000,"start":100000,"step":-1}],"output":0},{"input":[{"__gen__":"repeat","value":7,"n":100000}],"output":0},{"input":[{"__gen__":"concat","parts":[{"__gen__":"arange","n":50000,"start":50000,"step":-1},{"__gen__":"arange","n":50000,"start":0,"step":2}]}],"output":99998},{"input":[{"__gen__":"concat","parts":[[10000],{"__gen__":"repeat","value":0,"n":99999}]}],"output":0},{"input":[{"__gen__":"concat","parts":[{"__gen__":"repeat","value":0,"n":99999},[10000]]}],"output":10000},{"input":[{"__gen__":"ints","n":50000,"lo":0,"hi":3,"seed":611}],"output":3},{"input":[{"__gen__":"ints","n":50000,"lo":5000,"hi":5010,"seed":612}],"output":10},{"input":[[2,1]],"output":0},{"input":[[1,2]],"output":1},{"input":[[3,3]],"output":0},{"input":[[0]],"output":0},{"input":[[10000,0,10000]],"output":10000},{"input":[{"__gen__":"ints","n":4,"lo":0,"hi":10000,"seed":630}],"output":316},{"input":[{"__gen__":"ints","n":30,"lo":0,"hi":10000,"seed":631}],"output":9005},{"input":[{"__gen__":"ints","n":300,"lo":0,"hi":10000,"seed":632}],"output":9912},{"input":[{"__gen__":"ints","n":3000,"lo":0,"hi":10000,"seed":633}],"output":9994},{"input":[{"__gen__":"ints","n":30000,"lo":0,"hi":10000,"seed":634}],"output":10000},{"input":[{"__gen__":"ints","n":150000,"lo":0,"hi":10000,"seed":635}],"output":10000}],"hints":["Track the cheapest price seen so far while scanning left to right."],"complexity":"O(n) time, O(1) space","starter":{"python":"def maxProfit(prices):\n    # TODO: implement\n    pass\n","javascript":"/**\n * @param {*} prices\n * @return {*}\n */\nvar maxProfit = function (prices) {\n  // TODO: implement\n};\n"},"editorial":{"explanation":"You only ever sell after you buy, so at each day the best possible profit is today's price minus\nthe cheapest price seen *so far*.\n\nSweep left to right keeping two numbers: the minimum price seen and the best profit seen. Both\nupdate in constant time, so the whole thing is `O(n)` time and `O(1)` space.\n\nThis is Kadane's algorithm in disguise — run it on the array of day-to-day differences and you get\nthe same answer.","code":{"python":"def maxProfit(prices):\n    best = 0\n    low = float('inf')\n    for p in prices:\n        low = min(low, p)\n        best = max(best, p - low)\n    return best\n"},"complexity":"O(n) time, O(1) space"}}
